Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:23.47,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fn@FZLanTingYuan-DB-GBK\fs40\c&HEFF280&\3c&H0D1931&\bord1.4\frz271.7\pos(591.244,134.71)}这是刺身
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:28.26,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fn@FZLanTingYuan-DB-GBK\fs40\c&HB597FF&\3c&H0D1931&\bord1.4\frz289.4\pos(431.911,226.622)}也试试我的
